36, R31, R32, R57, R58, R60, C60, U11 (`motor_regulator`, TLV75530PDQNR, at X 0.0, Y 4.2), C83 (`motor_cap_in`, X 0.0, Y 5.45), C84 (`motor_cap_out`, X 1.27, Y 5.0, turned 90) (`design/architecture.md:705`; U11 to C84: `design/mech/thin/placement.csv:19` to `design/mech/thin/placement.csv:21`; the board file places U11 to C84 there, `design/ecad/ring/pcb/placement-final.csv:83` to `design/ecad/ring/pcb/placement-final.csv:85`), U9, R61 and R62 (now on U11's enable pin, `design/architecture.md:705`), R66, R63, R64, R65, C61, C72, C80, C81, C82, C71, C73, C74, C75, C78, C79, C76, C77, C85, C86, C87, C88 (`design/bom.csv:70` to `design/bom.csv:72`), L71 (`power_coil_1`), L72 (`power_coil_2`). Also on the parts face, in PASS 2: R73, the 330 kohm VBUS discharge resistor (`design/bom.csv:6`; `design/ecad/ring/pcb/fab/ring-pos-front.csv:66`), and C90, a second 10 uF on VDD_3V0 beside C79 (`design/bom.csv:74`; `design/ecad/ring/pcb/fab/ring-pos-front.csv:42`) (`design/wiring/lead-decisions.md:77`, `design/wiring/lead-decisions.md:79`). The motor switch and the motor diode of earlier versions are not fitted: they left the design (`design/architecture.md:705`). LED1, R41 and Q2 are removed in v7 and are not fitted (`design/architecture.md:834`). C13 is not mounted (`design/bom.csv:19`).
